# Keeps the Docker build context (sent to the daemon before `turbo prune`
# even runs) to source only. turbo prune / pnpm install regenerate every
# excluded-below directory inside the image themselves, so none of this is
# needed — and .env*/*.pem would otherwise ship local secrets into the build
# context even though no layer ultimately keeps them.

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.open-next
**/out
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
.git
.github

# Local env files — real values come from --build-arg / --secret in CI and
# from Coolify's runtime env, never from a committed or locally-present file.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
**/npm-debug.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# Scratch/ad-hoc output directories seen elsewhere in this repo — not part of
# any app's source.
lhout
